## Third-party components

The following files came from third parties and carry their own terms, which
survive independently of this file. None of them may have its notice stripped,
including when a file is moved or modernised — see `CODING_STANDARDS.md`.

| File | Origin | Terms |
|---|---|---|
| `NeuronCore/MathUtils.cpp` (Mersenne Twister, MT19937) | Makoto Matsumoto and Takuji Nishimura, 1997–2002 | BSD 3-clause, reproduced in the file. Requires the copyright notice and disclaimer be retained in source and binary redistributions. |

`GameData/` contains game content — models, textures, sounds, level and script
data — inherited with the original source. The provenance note above applies to
it in full, and it is the part of the repository least likely to be covered by
any source-code licence.
